                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "548459b0-cdb2-3788-a42e-c4a001058715",
                        "entry_id": "b80c66e2-3ce6-394f-8e2c-6f35a4b96a9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "специалист по аллергологии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e254116-a206-4060-9f81-d957fd2d5b75",
                                "sense_id": "548459b0-cdb2-3788-a42e-c4a001058715",
                                "text": "― Аллергологи в этом вопросе в течение многих лет ошибались, а родители, прислушиваясь к их советам, поступали неправильно, ― говорит доктор Деннис Р. Оунби, главный аллерголог и иммунолог Медицинского колледжа в Джорджии, руководивший этими исследованиями."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "882dbf95-e89d-489b-9393-aab4d4a88e94",
                        "source_entry_id": "b80c66e2-3ce6-394f-8e2c-6f35a4b96a9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "548459b0-cdb2-3788-a42e-c4a001058715",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                        "entry_id": "2fb2e20d-aebd-30ce-91b5-bc9bbd6612cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A doctor who specializes in the treatment of allergies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb7cfeb-e5d0-4b68-845e-441505e2c9b9",
                                                "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                                "text": "As it warms up, expect everything to bloom at once, creating what allergists call a pollen vortex."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847893c0-e42c-4518-b3e8-41187fcaaa9a",
                                                "sense_id": "6d8c9150-7562-3d94-9dcf-b6948872d475",
                                                "text": "Despite a rough beginning, this season might not continue to be so brutal, and the pollen vortex could soon become a distant memory. For now, pollen counts remain high, and people who want help with their symptoms should go see an allergist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4e45c32-6afd-4ccb-9102-0a7851d385fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "b80c66e2-3ce6-394f-8e2c-6f35a4b96a9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "548459b0-cdb2-3788-a42e-c4a001058715",
                        "target_lang_word": "allergologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allergologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2db157a9-1efe-386f-8b9b-bcd32e826bad",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c8c081-a6dd-3372-923b-e10856858b0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A scientist who studies allergology (the medicine of allergies)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad6dad03-ffa5-4c55-89cb-e77fe036d15d",
                                                "sense_id": "2db157a9-1efe-386f-8b9b-bcd32e826bad",
                                                "text": "To which the compatibilists replied, This is still totally artificial—choosing when to leap into an abyss or whether to turn left or right in a driving simulator tells us nothing about our free will in choosing between, say, becoming a nudist versus a Buddhist, or becoming an algologist versus an allergologist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b7f8fc-a99c-30d3-a62c-6a1cfacf9ed9",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c8c081-a6dd-3372-923b-e10856858b0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An allergist (a physician specializing in the treatment of allergies)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
